	)
	(text "lifepo4 -> DCDC\naround 75mohm of component resistance\naround 10mohm of trace resistance @ 70um thickness 200mm length\nand 5mm width\nBackup load: raspi@5W, esp32@1W, 1W reserve -> 7W\n2.2A current at 3.2V; 2.0A fully charged.\nVoltage drop: 2.2A*0.085mohm = 187mV\nthis calc. did not take into acount wire and contact resistance of the cell\nquite tight fit for lifepo4, possible fixes:\n-use LiIon -> 3.7V\n-throw off raspi via interrupt"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.686 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "fc13c71e-23f0-4191-a50c-b417a06a6614")
	)
